flowchart TB
    Hybrid[Hybrid Candidate Ranking] --> Bounded[Bounded Candidate Set<br/>with Opaque IDs]
    Bounded --> Reranker[Model Reranker]
    Reranker --> Structured[Structured Relevance Output]
    Structured --> Validation{Local Validation<br/>passes?}

    Validation -- Yes --> Reordered[Reranked Order<br/>with Omitted Candidates Appended]
    Reordered --> TopK[Final Top-K]

    Validation -- No --> Fallback[Preserve Original Hybrid Order]
    Reranker -. timeout / provider failure .-> Fallback
    Fallback --> TopK

